stage: resolve
---

dup-param-across-files/b.tck:3:11: error: size is already declared
02 |	
03 |	func grow(size int64) int64 {
   |	          ^~~~
04 |	    return size + 1
dup-param-across-files/a.tck:3:5: note: previous declaration of size
02 |	
03 |	var size int64 = 1
   |	    ^~~~
04 |	

